(vi) The applicant will not leave India without previous permission of the trial Court/Investigating Officer, as the case may be;
(vii) The applicant shall mark his presence once in a month before the concerned police station between 10:00 am to 2:30 pm till conclusion of trial.
(viii) Applicant shall not be a source of embarrassment and harassment to the complainant party in any manner and shall not move in the vicinity of the complainant otherwise, benefit of bail shall immediately withdrawn.
8. Application stands allowed and disposed of.
